# ADR-0026 metric-declaration allowlist (CONVENTIONS.md §6a).
#
# Format:  <repo-relative path>::<exact identifier>  # one-line justification
#
# The second field is the EXACT identifier the lint matched, lowercased -- `transit_delay`,
# not the `delay` stem. An entry exempts one binding and must never cover a family: keying
# on the stem would let one reviewed exception silently admit every metric named after it.
#
# This is a pressure valve, not a bypass. Every entry is reviewed. An entry without a
# justification fails the lint. An empty allowlist is the healthy state -- the usual fix is
# to move the formula into the pack as a MeasurementExpression, which is where ADR-0026
# says it belongs.
